#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Placeholder of the oper service field.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesOperPlaceholder"
