msgstr "البوت الذي ينفّذ G-line"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Label of the package select.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesPackage"
msgid "Services package"
msgstr "حزمة الخدمات"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Stands in for the package's name inside a sentence when it has none.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesPackageFallback"
