msgstr "الحزمة"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Field label: the IRC channel where services report the commands opers give them.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesReport"
