msgstr "قناة تقارير المشرفين"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Placeholder of the oper report channel field.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesReportPlaceholder"
msgid "Where services report oper commands"
msgstr "حيث تُبلغ الخدمات عن أوامر المشرفين"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Field label: the IRC channel where services post every connect and join (the snoop feed).
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesSnoop"
msgid "Snoop channel"
msgstr "قناة snoop"

#. Network form, 'Services support' section, shown to IRC operators: which IRC services package the network runs (e.g. X3) and the nicknames of its bots and channels. Jargon to keep: X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ, G-line, oper, snoop. Placeholder of the snoop channel field.
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue
msgctxt "form.servicesSnoopPlaceholder"
msgid "The connect and join feed"
msgstr "سجلّ الاتصالات والانضمامات"

#. Label of the connection-status row at the top of the network edit form (shown only while the app knows the network's live state).
#: client/components/NetworkForm.vue:26
