#. Shown under the sidebar's jump-to search field when nothing matches.
#: client/components/NetworkList.vue:55
msgctxt "sidebar.noResults"
msgid "No results found."
msgstr "لم يتم العثور على نتائج."

#. Screen-reader label of the thin handle on the edge of the sidebar (channel list) next to the chat. The arrow keys resize it when it has focus.
#: client/components/SidebarResizer.vue
